{
    "title": "Smule: Karaoke, Sing & Record",
    "description": "Unleash Your Musical Talent with Smule - The Original Karaoke App! \r\n\r\nSing over 10 million of your favorite songs with music & scrolling lyrics, and enjoy karaoke free anytime, anywhere! Join the global music community on Smule, the top singing app where you can record duets and solo performances with your camera on or off, or create music videos. Enhance your singing voice with professional audio effects and connect with millions of users worldwide, including fans and singers from around the world. Join singers in the karaoke community and sing alongside recordings of today\u2019s most popular music artists! \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a karaoke pro or just starting, Smule offers endless possibilities for collaboration, creativity, and sharing your talent with the world. With countless songs and genres to pick from, you'll easily find the music you love and the community that shares your passion.\r\n\r\nKaraoke is fun for everyone! Our app is perfect for singers of all skill levels. Practice your singing in private or share your music and collaborate with a supportive global community that loves to create and share their passion for making music. Smule makes it easy to learn with AI tools designed to help you improve your voice. With our on-screen pitch guide and original tutorials, you can enhance your skills and confidence as a singer.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Karaoke Anytime: Sing over 10+ million karaoke songs with music & scrolling lyrics. Enjoy karaoke online whenever you want with a massive catalog of songs!\r\n- Record & Share: Capture your singing in solo, duet, or group performances, and share your creations effortlessly with friends and the Smule community.\r\n- Vocal Recording: Professional-grade vocal recording tools with reverb and voice tune.\r\n- Music Video Creator: Create music videos with a karaoke mixer and add vocal effects that elevate your performances to professional levels.\r\n- Live Global Performances: Host or join live karaoke parties with the Sing Live feature, giving singing performances 24/7 with friends and music lovers worldwide!\r\n- Sing with Top Artists: Experience the thrill of singing side-by-side with famous artists like Dua Lipa, Olivia Rodrigo, and Ed Sheeran in recorded duets. Feel like a star!\r\n- Make Your Own Music: Use Smule as a music creator to record original songs or utilize our song maker features to invite others to collaborate in music collaboration.\r\n- Karaoke Challenges: Participate in exciting karaoke challenges and contests to win prizes and get noticed in the community. Join karaoke events to showcase your talent!\r\n- Singing Apps for Free: Explore a variety of features in our karaoke social platform, where you can sing online and connect with friends and creators!\r\n- Vocal Lessons: Improve your vocal skills with our vocal lessons and on-screen pitch guide, making it easy to sing better.\r\n- Effects & Filters: Turn on your camera for video performances and apply fun video effects and filters to enhance your recordings and get more engagement\r\n- Karaoke Together: Enjoy karaoke with friends and make memories as you create your favorite karaoke shows and parties!\r\n\r\nCONNECTING THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC\u2122\r\nSmule is more than just a karaoke app\u2014it\u2019s a global community where millions of music fans connect, collaborate, and share their passion. Whether you love pop, acappella, R&B, country, K-pop, musicals, rap, hip-hop or rock, Smule has something for everyone. Join us and make music part of your day.\r\n\r\nIf you love karaoke, enjoy singing along to songs, dream of recording a duet with a pop star, or simply love music, try karaoke app Smule for free now. Use our singing app as a music recording studio to record original songs & sing covers!\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media & keep up with the latest on Smule:\r\nhttp://www.smule.com\r\nhttp://www.facebook.com/smule\r\nhttp://www.youtube.com/smule\r\nhttp://www.tiktok.com/@smule\r\nQuestions? http://www.smule.com/support/sing#android",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unleash Your Musical Talent with Smule - The Original Karaoke App! <br><br>Sing over 10 million of your favorite songs with music &amp; scrolling lyrics, and enjoy karaoke free anytime, anywhere! Join the global music community on Smule, the top singing app where you can record duets and solo performances with your camera on or off, or create music videos. Enhance your singing voice with professional audio effects and connect with millions of users worldwide, including fans and singers from around the world. Join singers in the karaoke community and sing alongside recordings of today\u2019s most popular music artists! <br><br>Whether you\u2019re a karaoke pro or just starting, Smule offers endless possibilities for collaboration, creativity, and sharing your talent with the world. With countless songs and genres to pick from, you&#39;ll easily find the music you love and the community that shares your passion.<br><br>Karaoke is fun for everyone! Our app is perfect for singers of all skill levels. Practice your singing in private or share your music and collaborate with a supportive global community that loves to create and share their passion for making music. Smule makes it easy to learn with AI tools designed to help you improve your voice. With our on-screen pitch guide and original tutorials, you can enhance your skills and confidence as a singer.<br><br>Key Features:<br>- Karaoke Anytime: Sing over 10+ million karaoke songs with music &amp; scrolling lyrics. Enjoy karaoke online whenever you want with a massive catalog of songs!<br>- Record &amp; Share: Capture your singing in solo, duet, or group performances, and share your creations effortlessly with friends and the Smule community.<br>- Vocal Recording: Professional-grade vocal recording tools with reverb and voice tune.<br>- Music Video Creator: Create music videos with a karaoke mixer and add vocal effects that elevate your performances to professional levels.<br>- Live Global Performances: Host or join live karaoke parties with the Sing Live feature, giving singing performances 24/7 with friends and music lovers worldwide!<br>- Sing with Top Artists: Experience the thrill of singing side-by-side with famous artists like Dua Lipa, Olivia Rodrigo, and Ed Sheeran in recorded duets. Feel like a star!<br>- Make Your Own Music: Use Smule as a music creator to record original songs or utilize our song maker features to invite others to collaborate in music collaboration.<br>- Karaoke Challenges: Participate in exciting karaoke challenges and contests to win prizes and get noticed in the community. Join karaoke events to showcase your talent!<br>- Singing Apps for Free: Explore a variety of features in our karaoke social platform, where you can sing online and connect with friends and creators!<br>- Vocal Lessons: Improve your vocal skills with our vocal lessons and on-screen pitch guide, making it easy to sing better.<br>- Effects &amp; Filters: Turn on your camera for video performances and apply fun video effects and filters to enhance your recordings and get more engagement<br>- Karaoke Together: Enjoy karaoke with friends and make memories as you create your favorite karaoke shows and parties!<br><br>CONNECTING THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC\u2122<br>Smule is more than just a karaoke app\u2014it\u2019s a global community where millions of music fans connect, collaborate, and share their passion. Whether you love pop, acappella, R&amp;B, country, K-pop, musicals, rap, hip-hop or rock, Smule has something for everyone. Join us and make music part of your day.<br><br>If you love karaoke, enjoy singing along to songs, dream of recording a duet with a pop star, or simply love music, try karaoke app Smule for free now. Use our singing app as a music recording studio to record original songs &amp; sing covers!<br><br>Follow us on social media &amp; keep up with the latest on Smule:<br>http://www.smule.com<br>http://www.facebook.com/smule<br>http://www.youtube.com/smule<br>http://www.tiktok.com/@smule<br>Questions? http://www.smule.com/support/sing#android",
